window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-043-096fc1c0b333594f.json"]={sha256:"096fc1c0b333594fb837b9b12b97f519d6d89f2f79b28bcbf68a193fe06a236e",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-03197d83dc430913","url":"https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform","title":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","titleEn":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","publisher":"QuEra","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-043","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-043","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-044","referenceUrls":["https://queracomputing.github.io/bloqade/latest/analog/home/background/"],"title":"QuEra Aquila：Rydberg 交互作用的距離六次方","titleEn":"QuEra Aquila: sixth-power distance scaling of Rydberg interactions","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付逐原子搬移圖、分段損失與目標佔據驗收。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver atom-by-atom move maps, segment losses and target-occupancy acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『QuEra Aquila：Rydberg 交互作用的距離六次方』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付距離／作用曲線、局部線性誤差與幾何驗收圖。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'QuEra Aquila: sixth-power distance scaling of Rydberg interactions', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver distance/interaction curves, linearization errors and geometry acceptance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立搬移的生存代理P=s^m，s為單次存活、m為搬移次數；不假設移動越短就必然無損。 使用教學s=0.995、關鍵原子需m=10次搬移。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.995**10，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以−lnP=m(−lns)驗證累積；逐原子列表，不能把不同原子的搬移次數混為同一路徑。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：van der Waals區間V(r)=C6/r⁶；以V(r0)比值寫V(r)=V0(r0/r)⁶，避免混用角頻率與能量。 使用教學V0/h=10 MHz於r0=5 μm；不使用實際原子態的C6規格。 以手算或試算表計算名義式10*(5/5)**6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：確認V×r⁶固定；用微分δV/V≈−6δr/r只估很小擾動，不能拿20%變化直接替代精確式。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Independent-transport survival proxy P=s^m uses per-move survival s and move count m; shorter motion is not assumed lossless. Use Teaching s=0.995 and m=10 moves for a critical atom. Evaluate nominal expression 0.995**10 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Verify−lnP=m(−lns); list each atom separately rather than combining different paths.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: In the van der Waals regime V(r)=C6/r⁶; use V(r)=V0(r0/r)⁶ to keep angular-frequency and energy conventions consistent. Use Teaching V0/h=10 MHz at r0=5 μm; no real atomic-state C6 specification is assumed. Evaluate nominal expression 10*(5/5)**6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check invariant V×r⁶; use δV/V≈−6δr/r only for small perturbations, not as an exact20% change.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-053","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1"],"title":"PsiQuantum：雙光子融合的成功預算","titleEn":"PsiQuantum: a two-photon fusion success budget","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付逐原子搬移圖、分段損失與目標佔據驗收。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver atom-by-atom move maps, segment losses and target-occupancy acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"辨識兩路光子存活與內在融合成功率是不同乘數。","differenceEn":"Distinguish two-photon survival from intrinsic fusion success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立搬移的生存代理P=s^m，s為單次存活、m為搬移次數；不假設移動越短就必然無損。 使用教學s=0.995、關鍵原子需m=10次搬移。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.995**10，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以−lnP=m(−lns)驗證累積；逐原子列表，不能把不同原子的搬移次數混為同一路徑。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。內在融合成功率0.5；兩路總透射均0.8，每秒100000次嘗試。 R=R嘗試×p_f×η₁×η₂。 代入 100000*0.5*0.8**2，得到 32000 events/s。獨立損耗下P成功=p_f η₁η₂；此模型忽略暗計數與錯誤宣告。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Independent-transport survival proxy P=s^m uses per-move survival s and move count m; shorter motion is not assumed lossless. Use Teaching s=0.995 and m=10 moves for a critical atom. Evaluate nominal expression 0.995**10 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Verify−lnP=m(−lns); list each atom separately rather than combining different paths.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Intrinsic success0.5, transmission0.8 on each arm and100000 attempts/s. R=attempt rate×p_f×η1×η2. Substituting 100000*0.5*0.8**2 gives 32000 events/s. With independent loss Psuccess=p_f η1η2; dark counts and false heralds are excluded. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-96ecec88f91a75bd","url":"https://queracomputing.github.io/bloqade/latest/analog/home/background/","title":"Background: Neutral Atom Qubits","titleEn":"Background: Neutral Atom Qubits","publisher":"QuEra Bloqade","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-30f368cdd1d99110","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1","title":"Fusion-based quantum computation","titleEn":"Fusion-based quantum computation","publisher":"Bartolucci et al. / Nature Communications","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
